      "intents": [
        "bi-6"
      ],
      "one_line": "Understand what consumers want and what the competition is doing: from what the first capability of Run → Product took in, the needs and problems of the product's consumers, and what the products it competes with are doing, are drawn out, each finding with every item it rests on and how sure it is, placed on the business intents, capabilities and features it bears on, and handed to the product owner and to the next capability, so that what the product becomes next starts from what really happened in use and in the market.",
      "doc": "software-delivery-planning/understand-consumers-and-competition/capability.md",
      "identified_by": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "fn-understand-consumer-wants",
      "kind": "feature",
      "mode": "new",
      "slug": "fn-understand-consumer-wants",
      "capability": "cap-understand-consumers-and-competition",
      "intents": [
        "bi-6"
      ],
      "one_line": "Sorts the items the first capability took in into wants, the needs and problems that come up across many items, and sums each one: every item it rests on, quoted as taken in, how many items from which connections, how the count moved over time, and how sure it is.",
      "doc": "software-delivery-planning/understand-consumers-and-competition/fn-understand-consumer-wants/feature.md",
      "identified_by": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "fn-understand-competition",
      "kind": "feature",
      "mode": "new",
      "slug": "fn-understand-competition",
      "capability": "cap-understand-consumers-and-competition",
      "intents": [
        "bi-6"
      ],
      "one_line": "For each competitor the product owner follows, proposed from memory and from the rivals people name, draws from the same items what people say it does, offers or lacks, each finding with every item it rests on.",
      "doc": "software-delivery-planning/understand-consumers-and-competition/fn-understand-competition/feature.md",
      "identified_by": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "fn-place-findings",
