        "bi-6"
      ],
      "one_line": "Shows the product owner one current report of what consumers want and what the competition is doing, with what is new or has moved and the weak findings marked as weak, and hands the same findings, whole, to the next capability of Run → Product.",
      "doc": "software-delivery-planning/understand-consumers-and-competition/fn-hand-on-findings/feature.md",
      "identified_by": ""
    },
    {
